{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SOULPTOR&quot; is a turn-based PvP game inspired by curling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns firing their stones to enter the target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fired stones stop, the player gains as many points as the number of his/her stones in the target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player with more points at the end of all 7 turns wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use 3 stones each with various abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(add targets, destroy stones, build walls, etc...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players create their own decks with stones with different abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Online competition (random matching, keyword matching)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877300?t=1756634847","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877300?t=1756634847","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877300/53e104abde9fea22fdd7469b957b194c40f430c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756634847","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877300/53e104abde9fea22fdd7469b957b194c40f430c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756634847","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SOULPTOR&quot; is a turn-based PvP game inspired by curling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</stron